   "briefTitle": "Measure of the Long Term Influence of SPIRIVA® in Acute Respiratory Disorders",
   "officialTitle": "Effects of Inhaled Tiotropium Bromide on Severity of Airflow Obstruction During Long-term Treatment in Patients With Moderately Severe Copd. Impact on Severity and Incidence of Exacerbations."
  },
